# Anonymization

Cartographer is public OSS. Testdata, golden files, and inline test strings must
use fictional packages (`com.example`), hosts (`example.com`), and generic API
names — never material copied from internal service repos or fleet inventory.

When adding extraction behavior, document patterns in neutral language; do not
commit internal fixtures as examples.

Full policy: [docs/ANONYMIZATION.md](../../docs/ANONYMIZATION.md)
